CLASS zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvchanging DEFINITION PUBLIC FINAL CREATE PUBLIC.
 PUBLIC SECTION.
 CLASS-METHODS run RETURNING VALUE(rv) TYPE string.
 CLASS-METHODS val CHANGING p TYPE i RETURNING VALUE(r) TYPE i.
ENDCLASS.
CLASS zcl_gogen_t_dynrecvchanging IMPLEMENTATION.
 METHOD val. r = p. ENDMETHOD.
 METHOD run.
 DATA x TYPE i VALUE 7.
 TRY.
 CALL METHOD ('ZCL_GOGEN_T_DYNRECVCHANGING')=>('VAL') RECEIVING r = x.
 rv = |silent/{ x }|.
 CATCH cx_sy_dyn_call_param_missing.
 rv = |CX_SY_DYN_CALL_PARAM_MISSING/{ x }|.
 ENDTRY.
 ENDMETHOD.
ENDCLASS.
